drProtectionGroupId plus displayName and
type unique match; tracked rereads and
delete confirmation can additionally
narrow by drPlanId
end note
opt force-new or conflicting drift is detected
ServiceManager --> BaseReconciler: reject before OCI mutation
end
opt supported mutable drift is detected
ServiceManager -> OCI: Apply UpdateDrPlan only for mutable\nfields definedTags, displayName,\nfreeformTags, planGroups
loop update pending UPDATING
ServiceManager -> OCI: GetDrPlan
end
end
ServiceManager -> OCI: run helper hooks\ncreate=tfresource.CreateResource,\ntfresource.WaitForWorkRequestWithErrorHandling\nentity=drplan action=CREATED;\nupdate=tfresource.UpdateResource,\ntfresource.WaitForWorkRequestWithErrorHandling\nentity=drplan action=UPDATED;\ndelete=tfresource.DeleteResource
ServiceManager -> OCI: apply follow-up strategy\ncreate=GetWorkRequest -> GetDrPlan;\nupdate=GetWorkRequest -> GetDrPlan;\ndelete=GetDrPlan/ListDrPlans\nconfirm-delete
end
ServiceManager --> BaseReconciler: status=required,\nfinalizer=retain-until-confirmed-delete
end
BaseReconciler --> Controller: requeue on provisioning, updating,\nterminating
